The '''Lone Adventurer''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{Zone|The End}}. <!--They can sell the player a [[Void Sword]].--> 

== Quest ==
Upon first speaking to the '''Lone Adventurer''', they ask the player to kill {{Green|5}} [[Enderman|Endermen]]. After doing so, the '''Lone Adventurer''' will offer the player a {{Item|Void Sword}}, for {{c|200k}}. After either purchasing or not purchasing it, the '''Lone Adventurer''' will then move to the {{zone|Dragon's Nest}}, and ask the player to obtain all {{Green|8}} pieces of [[Ender Armor]].<br><br>Once wearing the full set of Ender Armor, the '''Lone Adventurer''' will ask the player to kill [[Seer|Seers]] to obtain a {{Item|Dragon Shortbow}}. Once having obtained it, the [[player]] must bring it back to the '''Lone Adventurer'''. Then, The '''Lone Adventurer''' asks the player to reach Combat Skill 18. Once reached, the player will then have to wait 1 [[SkyBlock Time|SkyBlock day]] before talking to them again. Once the time has passed, the '''Lone Adventurer''' will offer a menu displaying the [[player]]'s [[Ender Dragon|Dragon]] stats.

