&e[NPC] &6Lone Adventurer&f: Alright, not bad, not bad!
&e[NPC] &6Lone Adventurer&f: It took me a while to get that strong.
&e[NPC] &6Lone Adventurer&f: I use a &5Void Sword&f, it's a very powerful weapon.
&e[NPC] &6Lone Adventurer&f: It gets stronger with each piece of &5Ender Armor &fyou are wearing.
